Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.41,0:01:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks nothing like back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is San Francisco, dude,\Nhome of the Golden Gate Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention all the\Nseafood you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.57,0:01:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.35,0:01:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to see Pegasus. She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And based on the message he sent us, it\Nsounds like Pegasus is already in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This car, guarded with your\Nlight, they mustn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope we get to\Nhim before those thieves do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, we're approaching Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.93,0:01:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.05,0:01:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The less time I spend\Nhere, the better. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.97,0:01:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This place has nothing but bad memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:01:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiate the landing\Nsequence now. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're beginning our descent\Ninto Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure his majesty is\Nsomewhere in that castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to give him a royal beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks pretty empty in there I guess\NPegasus' staff is on vacation or something
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That means less people to get on my nerves
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's find this\Nlunatic so we can leave
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Airport staff is not responsible\Nfor lost or damaged luggage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This was your dumbest idea yet, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.73,0:02:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Weevil?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta love these steep roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Golden Gate Bridge, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The one and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look gold to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're taking all this in, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Earth to Yugi. Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop thinking about\Neverything we found out this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not every day that\Na magic gateway opens up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,between our world and a\Nworld where monsters live.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.07,0:03:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And on top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,some kind of giant super monster\Nis trying to destroy both worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And the only protection we\Nhave against it is this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But even that doesn't seem to be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that mega monster is\Nstill out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get to the bottom of\Nthis before it strikes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.91,0:03:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Pegasus just chickened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have fell down 200 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've just about run out of patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.65,0:04:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Pegasus, unless you've\Ncome to your senses and gone home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lack of patience\Nnever fails to amuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.55,0:04:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as irritating as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, where's the love, Kyber Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we've been through so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here to catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to duel you so\Nyou'll get out of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I ever do to deserve such hatred?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long list, and I'm short on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Most recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you stuck your nose where it didn't belong
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,when you started buying\Nup pieces of my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you're the\None who's been ruining my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:05:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,reputation lately by\Nstarting this monster scare,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you? Admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it look like\NDuel Monsters are taking
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,over the world just to get some attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.15,0:05:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, do you honestly believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you afraid to admit\Nwhat you truly think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That maybe these duel monsters are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know by now that I don't\Nbelieve in your hocus-pocus magic tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I certainly don't\Nbelieve in real monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still trying to get away with\Nthat I don't believe in magic speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's time to\Ngive that one a rest already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially after the time we shared\Nnot so long ago in this very castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,His soul is mine. But don't\Nworry, he won't be alone for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat me in a duel and I'll\Nrelease him as promised, but fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and not only will his soul remain in bondage\NBut yours will join it And of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,as always,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:06:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I stayed true to my promise\NBut you already know that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did you lose our duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber boy you've lost the only chance\Nyou had at rescuing your baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll spare you the agony of carrying\Non in this world without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the final fate of\Nyour soul, Seto Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it suddenly become a crime to reminisce\Nabout old times with good friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba boy? Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're trying to mess with my head by\Nbringing up what happened in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's old news.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, it's you who's gonna suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get this duel on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the rematch of the century.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.83,0:06:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find that this\Narena looks frighteningly familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well, here we are again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In the exact same spot where\NI devastated you last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So, ready for a repeat performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew I'd get to destroy\Nyou twice in one lifetime?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this duel over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner I annihilate you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.91,0:07:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the sooner I can get out of\Nhere and move on with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my brother's gonna\Ntake you apart, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, I see that you're still\NKaiba Boy's one and only fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, just stay back. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we both know what\Nthis madman is capable of,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and I want you at a safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate rematch is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're making history.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.81,0:07:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that's\Ngonna be history is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll be safe up here if\NPegasus decides to pull something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope my brother's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to beat this jerk in his own game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You've wasted enough of\Nmy time already, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me or are you always in a bad mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to play a friendly game here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so why don't you do yourself\Na favor and lighten up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as soon as I tear you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Light's Duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.77,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, since we're playing on my\Nfield today, I get to go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Better up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by summoning Toon\NAlligator in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Step up to the plate, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.21,0:09:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're using the same monsters you used\Nin our first duel to mess with my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're thinking\Nabout this way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.43,0:09:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here comes a little\Nsomething for you to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Spear Dragon, attack his Toon\NAlligator with Cyclone Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pathetic little Toon is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But since it was in defense mode, your\Nlife points are safe, right? Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.73,0:09:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my dragon's special\Nability, you lose 300 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Spear Dragon automatically\Nswitches to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.81,0:09:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.07,0:09:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be on my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we just dropped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we don't want any trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You twib should have thought about\Nthat before you landed on our street.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This card should spice things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a magical little\Nnumber i like to call
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,toon table of contents\Nwhat on earth is that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a magic card that\Nallows me to draw any
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,card from my deck with\Nthe word tune in the title
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,not again toon world don't\Nsound so disappointed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.31,0:10:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,of all the cards i've created this one's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,by far my favorite i'm\Nsure once you see it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll change your tune\Npresenting toon world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows me to summon any\Nand all of my Toon Monsters to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And Toon World's cost of admission\Nis a mere 1,000 life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why don't we start this show with\Na new favorite of mine, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Toon Match Sorcerer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.41,0:11:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He may seem harmless, but\Nhe has quite the temper!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in my world now, Kaiba Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Pegasus played\Nhis Toon World card,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,he can summon any Toon Monster he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's got tons of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.09,0:11:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to give you a taste\Nof your own medicine with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My cloning trap card!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try dueling\Nwith some originality?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you annoyed because I've made\Nit pointless for you to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.73,0:11:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean that one of us was using his brain\Ntoday, and I'm not talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you attack me, you'll\Ndestroy your own monster as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to give it a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.57,0:12:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've saved yourself for now. No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.13,0:12:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll play my favorite card. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I sacrifice Spear Dragon\Nand Tomb Mask Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon my blue-eyes white dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.09,0:12:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hungry, and your toon is on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll have to starve, because\Nin case you've forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.27,0:12:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,my toons can only be\Ndestroyed by other toons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that, but I\Nwon't let a technicality stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then maybe I can\Nstop you with this trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.69,0:12:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Tomb Mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This card lets me trade in my sorcerer\Nfor a tomb version of your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my blue-eyes tomb dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how much I hate that thing.\NYour cartoon dragon is a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To the original Blue Eyes. Don't you\Nrealize cartoons have feelings too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see how he feels about my next\Ncard I activate the magic card, Shrink
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes your puny dragon even punier
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All you did was make my\Nmonster more lovable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.57,0:13:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm through dealing with your\Npitiful excuse for a dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's focus on the real Blue Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This card makes its\Nattack even more fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.67,0:13:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Which part of Toons can't be\Ndestroyed, didn't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes, attack with White Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we clear now on the whole\Ntoons being indestructible thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but you seem to have forgotten\Nabout my Charm of Lamentation Magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it remains on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to draw one card\Nfrom my deck every time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,my Blue Eyes White\NDragon attacks and fails!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And since your toons can't be\Ndestroyed, I'll keep drawing cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to beating this washed-up\Nhas-been is somewhere in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to keep picking\Ncards till I find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start by giving up\N500 of my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.61,0:14:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows my blue-eyes toon dragon\Nto attack your life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.71,0:14:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come, my angry little toon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.05,0:14:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Unleash your fury upon Kaiba, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Negate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:14:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card\Nautomatically puts an end to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,your attack before it's\Nable to hit its target.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So you spent your life points for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.35,0:15:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to a magic card\Ncalled Toon Rollback.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.43,0:15:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me rewind our duel,\Ngiving me a second chance to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.49,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The rollback card doesn't\Nwork that way, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blue-eyes tomb dragon still\Ncan't attack twice in one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.23,0:15:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not my plan. Shame on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest paying attention instead\Nof jumping to conclusions. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, I have no intention\Nof attacking you with my dragon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no longer of any use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So I've decided to trade\Nhim in for something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Kaiba Boy's lifeboards, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She packs quite a little\Npunch, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And so do I!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.41,0:16:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes, attack his\NToon Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.41,0:16:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But those Toon monsters can't\Nbe destroyed by Blue-Eyes! Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, every time my\Nblue-eyes attack fails, I draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have missed the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a joke, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just as outdated\Nas your strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.03,0:17:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your toon monsters may be indestructible,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But only as long as you have your\NToon World magic card on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.29,0:17:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Without it, they're history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic card,\Na wingbeat of giant dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.93,0:17:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll return my\Nblue eyes to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can wipe all magic and trap\Ncards from your side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means your Toon World is toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my precious Toon World!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Seto! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I never doubted you for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:18:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish by summoning Versago\Nthe Destroyer in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.31,0:18:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Last chance, then I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.55,0:18:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking your silence as a\Nforfeit, not that I blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.39,0:18:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd quit too if my strategy\Nwas as lame as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're using the exact same tactics\Nyou used the first time we dueled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you've almost made\Nthe same moves card for card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lot of things, but\Npredictable isn't one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I just haven't been myself lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.07,0:18:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean that quite literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.59,0:18:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've waited for this day\Nfor a long time, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for\Ntricking me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good imitation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.93,0:19:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Alistair's the name Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card is about\Nto change everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating Seal of Orychalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as if you're gonna believe me? Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped in here\Ntill the duel's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.45,0:19:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, once I crush you,\NI'll be able to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.65,0:19:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you, on the other hand, won't\Nbe quite as lucky as myself, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When you lose, your soul will\Nbe locked away for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.15,0:19:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, you won't be set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.27,0:20:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
